# Boost on 33's end save (run.py hgss_boost: np_save4 add-mon behind the party, as a gift; the story stays played).
# Party before: 0 CYNDAQUIL (starter line), 1 Togepi (egg, 06), 2 SCYTHER (10, Cut), 3 PELIPPER (18, Surf/Fly),
# 4 the 26 carrier (Strength/Whirlpool/Waterfall, heartgold/26-*/boost.recipe) -> size 5. The legendary of 31 is
# fled from, not caught (HG Ho-Oh / SS Lugia), so both versions arrive with 5.
# Adds slot 5, the last free one: one strong member for the Elite Four and Lance, fighting behind a fainted lead
# (their auto_battle steps need send = "best" to send it before the weaker members). Lv50 is the top of the opponents'
# levels (files/poketool/trainer/trainers.json): TRAINER_ELITE_FOUR_WILL_WILL XATU 40, JYNX 41, EXEGGUTOR 41,
# SLOWBRO 41, XATU 42; TRAINER_ELITE_FOUR_KOGA_KOGA ARIADOS 40, VENOMOTH 41, FORRETRESS 43, MUK 42, CROBAT 44;
# TRAINER_ELITE_FOUR_BRUNO_BRUNO HITMONTOP 42, HITMONLEE 42, HITMONCHAN 42, ONIX 43, MACHAMP 46;
# TRAINER_ELITE_FOUR_KAREN_KAREN UMBREON 42, VILEPLUME 42, GENGAR 45, MURKROW 44, HOUNDOOM 47;
# TRAINER_CHAMPION_LANCE GYARADOS 46, DRAGONITE 49 x2, AERODACTYL 48, CHARIZARD 48, DRAGONITE 50.
# LAPRAS (personal.json: TM13, TM24, TM29, HM03; Ice Beam also its lv32 level-up move, wotbl.narc):
# Ice Beam x4 on Lance's Dragonite, x2 on Xatu, Exeggutor, Crobat, Vileplume, Murkrow; Thunderbolt x4 on Gyarados,
# x2 on Xatu, Slowbro, Crobat, Murkrow; Psychic x2 on Koga's poisons and Bruno's fighters; Surf x4 on Onix, x2 on
# Houndoom, Aerodactyl, Charizard.
# Party after: 6 (full).
party SPECIES_LAPRAS 50
party-move 5 0 MOVE_ICE_BEAM
party-move 5 1 MOVE_THUNDERBOLT
party-move 5 2 MOVE_PSYCHIC
party-move 5 3 MOVE_SURF
